---
import type { Props } from "@astrojs/starlight/props";
---

<div
  style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1e40af 0%, #1e3a8a 100%); color: white; text-align: center; padding: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.875rem;"
  role="banner"
  aria-label="Deprecation notice"
>
  Evalite is deprecated and no longer maintained. The recommended replacement is Langfuse: see the <a
    href="https://github.com/mattpocock/evalite#migrating-to-langfuse"
    style="color: white; text-decoration: underline;"
    >migration notes</a
  >.
</div>
